Response Fields: {{response_schema_summary}}

Task:
Classify the API into:
- resource
- capability
- stage
- whether it affects workflow structure

Guidelines:
- "affects_workflow" should be true ONLY if the API determines whether a workflow
  stage must exist or not.
- list/search/fetch APIs almost always have affects_workflow = false.
- parameter update APIs almost always have affects_workflow = false.
- login, reserve, run, release APIs usually have affects_workflow = true.
- Choose the stage where this API would be naturally executed.
